--- reconcile methods (5-method consensus) ---

╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  reconcile_methods.py — five-method ΔΔF consensus                 ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

PURPOSE
─────────
Compares five independent ΔΔF estimates:

  1. Target — Hu master-curve K2D,max ratios (from the source PPT)
  2. PhD PPT s25 — trans + rot + conf-WLC, her published values
  3. Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) — local closure_four_term.py
  4. Raw partition — bootstrap from raw_tether_partition_k2d.py
  5. WLC three-term reimpl — local closure_wlc_three_term.py

Reports pairwise gaps, z-scores against bootstrap σ, and an
inverse-variance weighted consensus. Saves figure + markdown table.

======================================================================
Q2: Method reconciliation — ΔΔF consensus
======================================================================

--- Method ΔΔF values ---
Method                    flex-rigid semi-rigid  semi-flex
-------------------------------------------------------
Target (Hu fit)               +3.560     +2.680     -0.900
PhD PPT s25                   +3.640     +2.470     -1.180
Four-term decomposition (S1-S23)     +3.960     +2.690     -1.270
Raw partition                 +3.324     +2.409     -0.915
s25 reimpl                    +5.231     +2.053     -3.178

--- Pairwise method gaps (kBT) ---

  flex-rigid:
    Target (Hu fit)        vs PhD PPT s25           : 0.080
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.400
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Raw partition         : 0.236
    Target (Hu fit)        vs s25 reimpl            : 1.671
    PhD PPT s25            vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.320
    PhD PPT s25            vs Raw partition         : 0.316
    PhD PPT s25            vs s25 reimpl            : 1.591
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs Raw partition         : 0.636
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs s25 reimpl            : 1.271
    Raw partition          vs s25 reimpl            : 1.907

  semi-rigid:
    Target (Hu fit)        vs PhD PPT s25           : 0.210
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.010
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Raw partition         : 0.271
    Target (Hu fit)        vs s25 reimpl            : 0.627
    PhD PPT s25            vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.220
    PhD PPT s25            vs Raw partition         : 0.061
    PhD PPT s25            vs s25 reimpl            : 0.417
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs Raw partition         : 0.281
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs s25 reimpl            : 0.637
    Raw partition          vs s25 reimpl            : 0.356

  semi-flex:
    Target (Hu fit)        vs PhD PPT s25           : 0.280
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.370
    Target (Hu fit)        vs Raw partition         : 0.015
    Target (Hu fit)        vs s25 reimpl            : 2.278
    PhD PPT s25            vs Four-term decomposition (S1-S23): 0.090
    PhD PPT s25            vs Raw partition         : 0.265
    PhD PPT s25            vs s25 reimpl            : 1.998
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs Raw partition         : 0.355
    Four-term decomposition (S1-S23) vs s25 reimpl            : 1.908
    Raw partition          vs s25 reimpl            : 2.263

--- Statistical significance ---
(σ on target from curve_fit covariance; σ on raw partition from bootstrap)
Pair            target σ    raw σ  max gap  z-score verdict
------------------------------------------------------------
flex-rigid        0.0256   0.0650    0.636     3.38  significant (z>3)
semi-rigid        0.0192   0.0510    0.281     4.97  significant (z>3)
semi-flex         0.0301   0.0710    0.370     0.19  statistical

⚠️ Target σ from curve_fit covariance underestimates true uncertainty
  for semi/flex (Hu master curve model assumption violated).
  TRUE σ on target is likely 0.1-0.2 kBT based on data scatter.

--- Inverse-variance weighted consensus ---
  flex-rigid: consensus = +3.423 ± 0.051 kBT (target +3.56, gap -0.137)
  semi-rigid: consensus = +2.465 ± 0.043 kBT (target +2.68, gap -0.215)
  semi-flex: consensus = -0.945 ± 0.054 kBT (target -0.90, gap -0.045)

